    "Existing session/role/orchestration entry points submit workers; receipts bind coordinator revision/generation, task ref, child session/run, backend, environment and tool authorization; accepted is not running or completed.",
    "Expired or revoked approvals are not reused; child tool policy cannot exceed the parent; unknown workers, unsupported backends and refused launches create no phantom completion.",
    "Receipts name the actual shared, in-process worktree or Git checkpoint backend; overlapping writes require verified checkout or write-set proof and otherwise serialize.",
    "Duplicate submission, reset/stop races and owner-restart retries have idempotent or fail-closed evidence, with a bounded default concurrency."
